<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6239" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβᾰτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skilled in mounting, ready at mounting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβατικώτεροι ἐπὶ τοὺς ἵππους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.3.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>fit to be ridden,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					15.6.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστράβη.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of the sign Capricornus,
				<i>affording an ascent</i> for souls, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of fever,
				<i>gradually increasing in heat</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάβασις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.4
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.337
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of
			irrigation-works, for <i>raising</i> water (?), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδρευμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					50.15
				</span></i>
			, al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
